  "description": "Probe and flash microcontrollers with IoTCom.Net: SWD/JTAG debug probes through probe-rs (CMSIS-DAP, ST-Link, J-Link, ESP USB-JTAG, FTDI, WCH-Link) for memory access, halt/run/reset and flashing; SEGGER RTT logs over any memory access; USB DFU 1.1 with ST DfuSe; Intel HEX, DFU/DfuSe and ELF firmware images; read-only by default; a simulated MCU, probe and DFU bootloader. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
